{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "request",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Describe the goal\n\nOrdinary request or evolvebook brief.\n\nCopied routing instructions guide the agent today; an enforced router remains proposed."
    },
    {
      "id": "plan",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Plan and prerequisites\n\nDefine scope, success criteria and dependencies.\n\nResolve material questions and required design approval."
    },
    {
      "id": "foundation",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 460,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Build and verify foundation\n\nScoped builder creates prerequisite contracts.\n\nRequired checks must pass before dependent work starts."
    },
    {
      "id": "feature",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Build the feature\n\nFresh context and explicit file ownership.\n\nIndependent tasks may run in parallel."
    },
    {
      "id": "gates",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## Behavior / visual / code\n\nObserved checks and independent findings.\n\nRequired failures and unknowns block acceptance."
    },
    {
      "id": "human",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1150,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## User acceptance\n\nAccept this specific result.\n\nCommit, push, merge and deployment permissions remain distinct."
    },
    {
      "id": "state",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 570,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## Proposed run state: the notebook\n\nGoal, scope, task status, prerequisites, blockers and next action.\n\nTarget: one authoritative record. Today: agent-maintained project notes."
    },
    {
      "id": "evidence",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 570,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## Evidence: the proof\n\nTests, screenshots, review findings and explicit acceptance.\n\nCode changes reopen checks whose proof is stale."
    },
    {
      "id": "ui",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 570,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Proposed brief / progress / review\n\nFriendly view of the same record.\n\nDashboard, forms and derived Finished / Still not done views remain planned."
    },
    {
      "id": "blocked",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -480,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "## Proposed bounded review loop\n\nInitial review plus at most two fix/re-review rounds.\n\nInstructions can request this today; runtime enforcement remains planned."
    },
    {
      "id": "status",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 570,
      "y": 1150,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "## Shipped foundation \u00b7 0.8.0\n\nSafe reruns/inventory; copied routing and host fallbacks; evolvebook helper; source npm package.\n\nLocal checks: 95 shell + 14 npm tests passed.\n\nLinux/macOS CI passed on Node 18, 22 and 24. Public registry release and live host/WSL trials remain unfinished."
    },
    {
      "id": "pending",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 990,
      "y": 1150,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "## Still not done\n\nEnforced run engine, evidence service, dashboard and evolvebook forms.\n\nPreview decision persistence and launcher fixes.\n\nPublic npm trial, WSL, live Claude Code and automatic instruction loading need observed evidence."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 990,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Try the shipped workflow\n\n[[npm-installation]]: source package and ownership.\n\n[[testing-from-a-to-z]]: isolated community trial, checklist and evidence.\n\nRegistry commands apply only after publication."
    }
  ],
